		{"id":"a3f2ea30d2d929e8","type":"text","text":"# Ne're Darke\nWants: To use [[The Mindrend Crown]] to gain more influence in Hallowcrest. Beleives they are unjustly mistreated due to their race and beliefs and deserve a say in how Hallowcrest and the expansion on the Silver Coast is done.","x":-720,"y":401,"width":382,"height":227},
		{"id":"bb32bb040c56b61a","type":"text","text":"# Keepers of Oak\n\nWants: To destroy [[The Mindrend Crown]]. Sees it as a disgrace to nature and believes no-one should keep it. ","x":560,"y":414,"width":250,"height":201},
